Subject: H3, no trailing authenticatorData bytes
Reason: With the ED flag clear, bytes after the COSE key (or after the 37-byte header of an assertion) were ignored, so malformed authData registered (audit 3); parsing must now consume the whole buffer.

diff -ruN a/Attestation/AuthenticatorData.php b/Attestation/AuthenticatorData.php
--- a/Attestation/AuthenticatorData.php
+++ b/Attestation/AuthenticatorData.php
@@ -79,6 +79,9 @@
 
         if ($this->_flags->extensionDataIncluded) {
             $this->_readExtensionData(\substr($binary, $offset));
+        } else if ($offset !== \strlen($binary)) {
+            // Without extension data nothing may follow the parsed fields.
+            throw new WebAuthnException('invalid authenticatorData: trailing bytes', WebAuthnException::INVALID_DATA);
         }
     }
 
